      "content": "\"stop the calculation entirely\"... that's a heavy way to put it. i guess what i mean is, if the investment is at zero, why keep paying the maintenance costs? why keep existing just to watch the debt pile up? it feels like the only way to actually stop the loss is to just exit the game.",
